---
title: Introduction
schema: User
---

Users represent the team members on a Buttondown account, along with their permission levels. Use the `/users` endpoints to list, retrieve, create, update, and delete teammates.

## Invitation statuses

```mermaid
flowchart
  pending e1@--> accepted
  pending e2@--> declined
  pending e3@--> revoked
  owner
  e1@{ animate: true }
  e2@{ animate: true }
  e3@{ animate: true }
```
